Re-appointment of Director:
Pursuant to Section 149(6) of the Companies Act, 2013 and Regulation 25 (8) of the SEBI Listing Regulations, all Independent Directors have submitted declarations confirming they meet the criteria of Independence. They have further confirmed that compliance with the Company’s Code of Conduct and that they are not debarred by any SEBI order. The Board has formally taken these declarations on record.
